Tasks:

{{#if logic_options contains "THINKTAGS" || logic_options contains "THOUGHTTAGS"}}<{{getvar::thinkTag}}>{{/if}}

0. Game State: What is the exact character positioning in the scene? If an OOC command is present, incorporate it immediately.

